-- The old Celeron lineage blocked the whole hub waiting forever for an
-- external Pastebin to create Lighting.BUFFERSTRINGS. Air Dribble lived in
-- an earlier task.spawn, which is why it was the only Main section visible
-- whenever that external bootstrap failed.
--
-- Only two legacy buffers are still consumed by this build:
--   base     = bytenet_use packet id + trailing \1
--   grabball = bytenet_findBall packet id
-- Both are derivable from the game's current Networking map.
